 but modified to return a new string sequence rather than modifying an array in place.Constraints: $1 \le \text{length of string} \le 10^5$; 
 string contains lowercase English letters only.Example Test Case:Input: "aaaabeee"Output: "a4be3" (Note that 'b' has no numeric suffix because
